<h2>Email Throttle Warning</h2>

<p>The IDP application is approaching the daily email sending limit.</p>

<table style="border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1em 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; font-weight: bold;">Date:</td>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em;"><%= @date %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; font-weight: bold;">Emails sent:</td>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em;"><%= @count %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; font-weight: bold;">Daily limit:</td>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em;"><%= @limit %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr style="background: #fff3cd;">
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; font-weight: bold;">Remaining:</td>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; color: #856404;"><strong><%= @remaining %> emails</strong></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="background: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; padding: 1em; margin: 1em 0;">
  <strong>Action required:</strong> The application will automatically stop sending emails once the limit is reached.
  Monitor email volume to ensure critical emails can be sent.
</p>
